              "number": 7,
              "title": "Add widget caching layer",
              "url": "https://github.com/acme/widgets/pull/7",
              "state": "OPEN",
              "isDraft": false,
              "reviewDecision": "CHANGES_REQUESTED",
              "body": "## Summary\n\nAdds an in-memory **LRU cache** in front of `WidgetStore.get()` so hot widgets stop hitting the database on every render.\n\n- cache size is configurable (`WIDGET_CACHE_SIZE`, default 500)\n- entries are invalidated on `save()` and `remove()`\n- see [the design doc](https://example.com/design) for background\n\n## Usage\n\n```ts\nconst store = new WidgetStore({ cache: { max: 500 } });\nconst w = await store.get('w_123'); // miss -> db\nconst again = await store.get('w_123'); // hit\n```\n\n## Test plan\n\n1. `npm test`\n2. Run the benchmark: p95 drops from 38ms to 4ms.\n\n> Note: the cache is per-process, a shared cache is out of scope.\n",
              "createdAt": "2026-11-03T09:12:00Z",
              "baseRefName": "main",
              "headRefName": "feature/widget-cache",
              "baseRefOid": "0000000000000000000000000000000000000000",
              "headRefOid": "a1b2c3d4e5f60718293a4b5c6d7e8f9012345678",
